widl + winmd install: complete the 11.18 SharedStorageAccessManager login fix on 11.19

0085 ports 11.18's 0053-twinapi-appcore-SharedStorageAccessManager-loginfix
but deliberately leaves out its tools/widl/metadata.c and
include/Makefile.in hunks ("already in this set"). They are not:

- No 11.19 patch emits GenericParam rows or TypeDefs for parameterized
  (generic) interfaces, so a winmd referencing e.g.
  IAsyncOperation<StorageFile> -- exactly what
  SharedStorageAccessManager.RedeemTokenForFileAsync returns -- leaves
  the CLR with a TypeRef it can never resolve, and Affinity's
  ProcessCommandLineArguments still throws TypeLoadException on the
  affinity:// OAuth callback path. Port those hunks here.
- No 11.19 patch adds windows.applicationmodel.datatransfer.winmd,
  windows.foundation.winmd or windows.storage.streams.winmd to
  INSTALL_LIB, so 0085 registers winmds in wine.inf that are never
  installed and RoResolveNamespace cannot find them. Add them.

Upstream 11.19 already implements RoResolveNamespace and declares
SharedStorageAccessManager in the IDL, so 11.18's 0032 and the IDL halves
of 0053 are correctly left out; this patch carries only the two missing
halves. Applies after 0085 with no fuzz.
